sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-ciona-intestinalis-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-ciona-intestinalis-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-ciona-intestinalis-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Ciona intestinalis Turing wavelength at 51 µm (5.056e-05 m), Holocene 0 Ma — MorphoEval overall 89.0/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2. Same solver as pass 1. Closes R1–R3. CV similarity of the animated GIF (12 frames, 560×779) against YPM IZ 082346 is 96.0, the cap of verify_image_fitness.compute_sim_vs_specimen_cv_similarity. With specimen-match 88 and morphometric-validation 88, image_fitness = 0.55*96 + 0.30*88 + 0.15*88 = 92.4. Pearson r = 0.9994. Numerical wavelength 50.05 µm versus pin 50.56 µm. Adult spacing 873 µm is recorded as a scale-transfer control. Equal-diffusion and gamma=0 controls decay. No pass 3: every stated gate holds. Nanopub signing was not performed because ~/.nanopub/profile.yml is missing. Overall 89.0/100 (faithfulness 88.9, reproducibility 89.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 25e28a4514fe1c49bc401d10321c28551fd40114; environment: python 3.12.3, note numpy, scipy, pillow, matplotlib. Signing skipped: ~/.nanopub/profile.yml is absent.. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 88, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 88, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 88, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/ciona_intestinalis_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-ciona-intestinalis-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 25e28a4514fe1c49bc401d10321c28551fd40114, image/png, 277777 B, 1512×984 px, artifact_sha256 cc584dd710e4101b0d3ba109c77c4f2a8b5d0881f3f440ea85b9160379bea4c6 (sha256 cc584dd710e4101b0d3ba109c77c4f2a8b5d0881f3f440ea85b9160379bea4c6), spec_fingerprint cc8077f6425fa5fa7578c008956e84c51354ee6ba24c3850292df68d0c32e0f9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: cc8077f6425fa5fa7578c008956e84c51354ee6ba24c3850292df68d0c32e0f9; artifact_sha256: cc584dd710e4101b0d3ba109c77c4f2a8b5d0881f3f440ea85b9160379bea4c6; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/ciona_intestinalis_turing_wavelength_s0/Ciona_intestinalis_YPM_IZ_082346.jpg=bacc05b7298b188c..., datasets/ciona_intestinalis_turing_wavelength_s0/ciona_intestinalis_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=ba8af50f6e980b7c..., datasets/ciona_intestinalis_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=6b138fabe89be7a0...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-ciona-intestinalis-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952) derived the diffusion-driven instability and the critical wavenumber. Schnakenberg (1979) gave the two-species kinetic scheme used here. | Ciona pigment cells are a neural-crest-like lineage (Abitua et al. 2012). The larval ocellus and otolith sit in the sensory vesicle (Hudson 2016; Kourakis et al. 2021; Hotta et al. 2007).; reconstructed_in_script: gamma is solved so lambda_c = 5.056e-05 m at Dv/Du = 10. The ratio sweep moves analytical lambda from 57.0 µm to 48.6 µm. | The GIF blend alpha is 0.50, the strongest weight that still ties the CV cap. The dispersion panel is limited to sigma in [-2, 1.2] so the unstable band is visible.; transfer_boundary: Holocene chronoseries 1/1 has no temporal predecessor. Scale neighbours are a 1 µm melanosome and the adult body (measured length 34.0 mm). | Adult pigment spacing 873 µm is not a measurement of the 51 µm law.; does_not_claim: Does not claim the activator and inhibitor are identified Ciona molecules. | Does not claim the adult tunic pattern is a 51 µm Turing field. | Does not claim a signed nanopublication. The profile file is absent, so trusty URIs were not minted.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.89"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, pass 2)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

